<title>USA: McLeod completes Telecom*USA acquisition.</title>
<headline>McLeod completes Telecom*USA acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR RAPIDS, Iowa 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>McLeod Inc said Monday it completed its previously announced acquisition of all outstanding shares of Telecom*USA Publishing Group Inc for about $74 million cash and assumption of debt.</p>
<p>Telecom*USA, which had gross revenues of about $51 million for the 12 months ended July 31, 1996, publishes about eight million telephone directories in about 5,000 communities in 15 states.</p>
<p>McLeod is a provider of integrated local and long distance services to business and residential customers.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
